  "description": "The Backroad FF stands for performance off the tarmac. Aerodynamics, comfort and catering were the top priorities during development – so that you can give your all in the race against yourself or others. Highlights of the Gravel-Race model platform • Gravel Race One-Piece Cockpit – built for speed • Plenty of tyre clearance – up to 45 mm tyre clearance • 4iiii powermeter measures your performance • Well thought-out bag concept – magnetic, practical, beautiful The Backroad FF GRX RX825 Di2 is also equipped with the new SHIMANO GRX RX825 Di2 groupset, ROSE GC50 wheels and Schwalbe G One RS tyres as well as the Selle Italia Flite Boost saddle in combination with the ROSE Aero D-Shape seat post. ¹ approx. 8.2 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for frame colour pistachio, frame size M, without pedals * Individual deviations are possible due to the hand-applied paint structure",
